# Git ignores for the charts/ directory tree (patterns are relative to this
# file's directory).
#
# Each chart carries a `charts/*.tgz` subdir (vendored dep tarballs generated
# by `helm dependency update`, run via `make deps`). Tarballs regenerate on
# every dep change and bloat PR diffs. Chart.lock, by contrast, IS tracked:
# it pins the dependency versions for reproducible builds (the lock tracks
# whatever dependencies exist in Chart.yaml).

# Vendored dep tarballs (per chart)
*/charts/
*/*.tgz
